Subject: [PATCH 1/5] SCH-103: Add owner-transaction queue admission candidate

Serialize the authorized workspace domain before reading the owner's durable eligible queue and current reservation shares. Reuse exact reservation replay and the existing quota and release checks; commit dequeue and holds through the owner's borrowed transaction.

Add PostgreSQL concurrency, rollback, cancellation, scope and lost-commit-acknowledgement regressions. Document the exact missing training readers, hook sites, release transitions and owner acceptance tests without changing training or the production catalog.

Verified gofmt, git diff --check, repository layout and roadmap checks. The new path is not yet compiled or run: the shared Linux heavy-test sequence and I/O pressure gate have not been available. Keep SCH-103 open and do not promote this candidate before the required runtime gates pass.
